icle","03",{"className":"security-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"item-number","children":"03"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"item-kicker","children":"AppContainer 与 Seatbelt"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"本地 MCP server 默认从操作系统沙盒启动。"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"启用的本地 stdio 服务在 Windows 默认使用 AppContainer，在 macOS 默认使用 Seatbelt。文件访问限制在任务工作区与私有运行目录，网络和环境变量按服务配置。"}]]}],["$","article","04",{"className":"security-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"item-number","children":"04"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"item-kicker","children":"可执行扩展"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"信任绑定项目与内容哈希。"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"扩展必须获得显式信任后才会启用，并默认使用平台原生沙盒。Full local access 只属于扩展兼容选项，不会改变 Pi bash、Terminal 或 MCP 权限。"}]]}],["$","article","05",{"className":"security-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"item-number","children":"05"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"item-kicker","children":"凭据"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"密钥使用操作系统保护存储。"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Artemis 通过 Electron safeStorage 保存支持的凭据。配置导入可以按类别选择，且不得静默复制凭据。"}]]}],["$","article","06",{"className":"security-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"item-number","children":"06"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"item-kicker","children":"项目优先记忆"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"记忆有边界，也永远不会高于当前请求。"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"经验记忆经过验证、优先限定在项目内，并低于当前请求和系统策略；密钥与临时任务状态不应进入记忆。"}]]}],["$","article","07",{"className":"security-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"item-number","children":"07"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"item-kicker","children":"浏览器边界"}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Web 可以运行，但不会继承桌面权限。"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Browser 支持 HTTP、HTTPS、JavaScript、Cookie 与 Web Storage，但不暴露 Node integration、preload API 或本地文件访问。"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section-shell security-note","children":[["$","div",null,{"child